{"text":"Same person, entirely different experience from the customer who will engage with Noah. So we in leadership are always criticizing the people. We're always saying, we've got to get the right people on the bus. I've got to fill my team. I've got to get the right people. But the reality is, it's not the people. It's the leadership. If we create the right environment, we will get people like Noah at the Four Seasons. If we create the wrong environment, we will get people like Noah at Caesar's Palace. It's not the people. And yet we're so quick to hire and fire, you can't hire and fire your children. If your kids are struggling, we don't say, you've got to see at school, you're up for adoption. So why is it that when somebody has performance problems at work, why is it that our instinct is to say, you're out?","words":[{"text":"Same","start":0.82,"end":1.26},{"text":"person","start":1.26,"end":1.7,"punct":","},{"text":"entirely","start":2.44,"end":2.98},{"text":"different","start":2.98,"end":3.92},{"text":"experience","start":3.92,"end":4.66},{"text":"from","start":4.66,"end":5.22},{"text":"the","start":5.22,"end":5.36},{"text":"customer","start":5.36,"end":6.12},{"text":"who","start":6.12,"end":6.42},{"text":"will","start":6.42,"end":6.52},{"text":"engage","start":6.52,"end":6.9},{"text":"with","start":6.9,"end":7.32},{"text":"Noah","start":7.32,"end":7.54,"punct":"."},{"text":"So","start":8.16,"end":8.3},{"text":"we","start":8.3,"end":8.48},{"text":"in","start":8.48,"end":8.66},{"text":"leadership","start":8.66,"end":8.92},{"text":"are","start":8.92,"end":9.16},{"text":"always","start":9.16,"end":9.36},{"text":"criticizing","start":9.36,"end":9.88},{"text":"the","start":9.88,"end":10.16},{"text":"people","start":10.16,"end":10.48,"punct":"."},{"text":"We're","start":10.8,"end":10.86},{"text":"always","start":10.86,"end":11.12},{"text":"saying","start":11.12,"end":11.4,"punct":","},{"text":"we've","start":11.54,"end":11.64},{"text":"got","start":11.64,"end":11